{title: Holy Spirit}
{artist: Kari Jobe}
{composer: Bryan James Torwalt y Bryan & Katie Torwalt}
{key: E}
{source: https://tabs.ultimate-guitar.com/tab/kari-jobe/holy-spirit-chords-1812030}

{start_of_verse}
[E]                                             [A]
There's nothing worth more that will ever come close
                                          [E]
No thing can compare, You're our living hope
          [A]
Your presence, Lord
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E]
Holy Spirit, You are welcome here
[A]                                 [F#m]
Come flood this place and fill the atmosphere
       [E]
Your glory, God, is what our hearts long for
         [A]               [F#m]  [E]
To be overcome by Your presence, Lord
{end_of_chorus}

